---
interface Props { data: any }
const { data } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="hours-experience">

    <section class="hero"><div class="wrap crumb"><b>Trabajo</b> &nbsp;/&nbsp; Horas extra</div><div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div class="copy"><span class="eyebrow">Calculadora laboral 2026</span><h1>Cada hora de más<br>tiene un valor<br>distinto.</h1><p>Calculá cuánto te corresponde por horas al 50%, al 100% y trabajo nocturno. Con un desglose listo para comparar con tu recibo.</p><div class="chips"><span>⏱️ LCT art. 201</span><span>✓ Recargos separados</span><span>🔒 Cálculo privado</span></div><div class="clock-art"><div class="clock"><b>18:42</b></div><div class="receipt"><small>EXTRAS DEL MES</small><strong>$135.000</strong><span>+11,3% sobre tu sueldo</span></div><span class="bonus-tag">Tu tiempo extra, bien pagado</span></div></div>
      <form class="calc" id="calculator"><div class="calc-title"><div><h2>Calculá tus horas extra</h2><p>Empezamos con el caso más habitual.</p></div><span class="tag">Ley vigente</span></div><div class="section-label">¿Qué querés calcular?</div><div class="cases"><button type="button" class="case active" data-case="weekday"><i>💼</i>Día hábil · 50%</button><button type="button" class="case" data-case="weekend"><i>☀️</i>Domingo/feriado · 100%</button><button type="button" class="case" data-case="mixed"><i>🧾</i>Recibo completo</button><button type="button" class="case" data-case="night"><i>🌙</i>Trabajo nocturno</button></div><div class="section-label">Tus datos</div><div class="fields"><div class="field wide"><label>Sueldo bruto remunerativo</label><div class="inline"><b>$</b><input id="salary" inputmode="numeric" value="1.200.000"></div></div><div class="field"><label>Divisor mensual</label><input id="divisor" type="number" min="1" value="200"></div><div class="field"><label id="hours-label">Horas extra al 50%</label><input id="hours" type="number" min="0" step=".5" value="10"></div><div class="field mixed-field"><label>Horas extra al 100%</label><input id="hours100" type="number" min="0" step=".5" value="4"></div><div class="field night-field"><label>Horas nocturnas</label><input id="night-hours" type="number" min="0" step=".5" value="0"></div></div><div class="advanced"><span>✓ Base: conceptos remunerativos</span><button type="button" id="advanced-toggle">+ Afinar cálculo</button></div><div class="extra" id="extra-fields"><div class="field"><label>Plus nocturno del convenio</label><div class="inline"><input id="night-plus" type="number" min="0" value="0"><b>%</b></div></div><div class="field"><label>Tope mensual a controlar</label><input id="monthly-limit" type="number" min="1" value="30"></div></div><section class="result"><div class="result-top"><div><small id="result-label">Te corresponde por 10 horas al 50%</small><div class="amount" id="result-amount">$90.000</div></div><div class="hour-card"><small>Valor hora normal</small><strong id="normal-hour">$6.000</strong></div></div><div class="stats"><span>Hora al 50%<b id="rate50">$9.000</b></span><span>Hora al 100%<b id="rate100">$12.000</b></span><span>Horas cargadas<b id="total-hours">10 h</b></span></div><button class="go" type="button" id="update">Actualizar cálculo</button></section></form>
    </div></section>
    <section class="breakdown"><div class="wrap"><header class="center"><span>Tu recibo, concepto por concepto</span><h2>Entendé de dónde sale el total</h2><p>El valor de la hora normal es la base. Después se aplica el recargo según el día y el horario en que trabajaste.</p></header><div class="break-grid"><article class="card"><h3>Desglose estimado</h3><div class="row"><span>Horas al 50%</span><div class="bar"><i id="bar50" style="width:75%"></i></div><b id="detail50">$90.000</b></div><div class="row"><span>Horas al 100%</span><div class="bar"><i id="bar100" style="width:40%"></i></div><b id="detail100">$48.000</b></div><div class="row"><span>Plus nocturno</span><div class="bar"><i id="bar-night" style="width:0%"></i></div><b id="detail-night">$0</b></div><div class="total"><strong>Total de extras</strong><strong id="detail-total">$138.000</strong></div></article><article class="card formula"><h3>La fórmula, sin vueltas</h3><div class="formula-step"><i>1</i><div><b>Calculamos tu hora normal</b><span>Sueldo bruto ÷ divisor mensual.</span></div></div><div class="formula-step"><i>2</i><div><b>Aplicamos el recargo</b><span>× 1,5 en día hábil o × 2 en domingo y feriado.</span></div></div><div class="formula-step"><i>3</i><div><b>Multiplicamos por tus horas</b><span>Cada tipo se calcula por separado.</span></div></div><div class="warning">⚠️ El convenio colectivo puede usar un divisor más favorable o sumar adicionales remunerativos a la base.</div></article></div></div></section>
    <section class="rates"><div class="wrap"><header class="center"><span>Los tres escenarios</span><h2>El momento define el recargo</h2><p>No todas las horas que exceden tu jornada se pagan igual.</p></header><div class="rate-grid"><article class="rate"><i>💼</i><h3>Día hábil o sábado hasta las 13</h3><p>La hora normal recibe un adicional del cincuenta por ciento.</p><strong>× 1,5</strong><span>Recargo del 50%</span></article><article class="rate"><i>☀️</i><h3>Sábado después de las 13, domingo o feriado</h3><p>La hora normal recibe un adicional del cien por ciento.</p><strong>× 2</strong><span>Recargo del 100%</span></article><article class="rate"><i>🌙</i><h3>Trabajo nocturno entre las 21 y las 6</h3><p>Cada hora nocturna equivale a 1 hora y 8 minutos; el convenio puede sumar un plus.</p><strong>+ 8 min</strong><span>Por cada hora nocturna</span></article></div></div></section>
    <section class="limits"><div class="wrap limits-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">Los límites legales</span><h2>Hacer extras también tiene un tope.</h2><p>El Decreto 484/2000 limita la cantidad de horas suplementarias. La calculadora te avisa si la carga mensual supera el máximo general.</p></div><div class="limit-card"><div><small>TOPE POR DÍA</small><b>3 horas</b><span>Como referencia de jornada extendida</span></div><div><small>TOPE POR MES</small><b>30 horas</b><span>Horas suplementarias</span></div><div><small>TOPE POR AÑO</small><b>200 horas</b><span>Máximo general</span></div></div></div></section>
    <section class="night"><div class="wrap night-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow" style="color:#8fc5ff">Nocturnidad sin confusión</span><h2>De noche no siempre es “50% más”.</h2><p>La LCT reduce la jornada nocturna: cada hora trabajada entre las 21 y las 6 equivale a una hora y ocho minutos. El porcentaje adicional depende de tu convenio.</p></div><div class="night-card"><div><small>HORARIO NOCTURNO</small><b>21 → 6 h</b><span>Art. 200 LCT</span></div><div><small>EQUIVALENCIA</small><b>1 h 08 min</b><span>Por cada hora trabajada</span></div><div><small>PLUS DE CONVENIO</small><b>Variable</b><span>Revisá tu CCT o recibo</span></div></div></div></section><div class="foot"></div>

  <section class="support wrap">
    <div><h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2>{data.faq.map((f:any,i:number)=><details open={i===0}><summary>{f.q}</summary><p set:html={f.a}/></details>)}</div>
    <aside><h2>Fuentes</h2>{data.sources.map((s:any)=><a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">{s.name}<small>{s.publisher}</small></a>)}</aside>
  </section>
</div>
<script is:inline>

    const $=s=>document.querySelector(s), money=n=>new Intl.NumberFormat("es-AR",{style:"currency",currency:"ARS",maximumFractionDigits:0}).format(Math.round(n)), number=v=>Number(String(v).replace(/\./g,"").replace(",", "."))||0;
    let activeCase="weekday";
    function calculate(){
      const salary=number($("#salary").value),divisor=Math.max(1,number($("#divisor").value)),h50=Math.max(0,number($("#hours").value)),h100=Math.max(0,number($("#hours100").value)),night=Math.max(0,number($("#night-hours").value)),nightPlus=Math.max(0,number($("#night-plus").value));
      const normal=salary/divisor,rate50=normal*1.5,rate100=normal*2;
      let amount50=h50*rate50,amount100=h100*rate100,amountNight=night*normal*(nightPlus/100),total=0,label="",hours=0;
      if(activeCase==="weekday"){total=amount50;hours=h50;label=`Te corresponde por ${h50} horas al 50%`}
      if(activeCase==="weekend"){total=amount100;hours=h100;label=`Te corresponde por ${h100} horas al 100%`}
      if(activeCase==="mixed"){total=amount50+amount100+amountNight;hours=h50+h100+night;label="Total estimado de extras del mes"}
      if(activeCase==="night"){total=amountNight;hours=night;label=nightPlus?`Plus nocturno del ${nightPlus}%`:"Equivalencia nocturna: 8 minutos por hora"}
      $("#result-label").textContent=label;$("#result-amount").textContent=activeCase==="night"&&!nightPlus?`${Math.round(night*8)} minutos compensatorios`:money(total);$("#normal-hour").textContent=money(normal);$("#rate50").textContent=money(rate50);$("#rate100").textContent=money(rate100);$("#total-hours").textContent=`${hours} h`;
      $("#detail50").textContent=money(amount50);$("#detail100").textContent=money(amount100);$("#detail-night").textContent=money(amountNight);$("#detail-total").textContent=money(amount50+amount100+amountNight);
      const max=Math.max(amount50,amount100,amountNight,1);$("#bar50").style.width=`${amount50/max*100}%`;$("#bar100").style.width=`${amount100/max*100}%`;$("#bar-night").style.width=`${amountNight/max*100}%`;
    }
    document.querySelectorAll(".case").forEach(b=>b.addEventListener("click",()=>{document.querySelectorAll(".case").forEach(x=>x.classList.remove("active"));b.classList.add("active");activeCase=b.dataset.case;$("#hours-label").textContent=activeCase==="weekend"?"Horas extra al 50% · para comparar":"Horas extra al 50%";calculate()}));
    document.querySelectorAll("input").forEach(i=>i.addEventListener("input",calculate));
    $("#advanced-toggle").addEventListener("click",e=>{$("#extra-fields").classList.toggle("open");e.currentTarget.textContent=$("#extra-fields").classList.contains("open")?"− Ocultar opciones":"+ Afinar cálculo"});
    $("#update").addEventListener("click",e=>{calculate();e.currentTarget.textContent="✓ Cálculo actualizado";setTimeout(()=>e.currentTarget.textContent="Actualizar cálculo",1200)});
    calculate();

</script>
<style>
.hours-experience{width:100%;overflow:hidden;color:#10223c;background:#fff}

    *{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;color:#10223c;background:#fff}button,input,select{font:inherit}button{cursor:pointer}.wrap{width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto}
    .top{height:88px;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe7ef;display:flex;align-items:center;background:#fff}.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;font-size:18px;font-weight:850}.logo{width:31px;height:31px;border-radius:7px;background:#173452;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-size:13px}.links,.tools{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:27px}.links a{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#43526a}.tools span{border:1px solid #d9e2eb;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 14px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.tools .profile{background:#132844;color:#fff;border-color:#132844}
    .hero{background:linear-gradient(128deg,#f6faff 0%,#f6faff 59%,#fff7e9 100%);padding:25px 0 62px;overflow:hidden}.crumb{font-size:12px;color:#718299;margin-bottom:32px}.crumb b{color:#126ec6}.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.88fr 1.12fr;gap:52px;align-items:start}.hero-grid>*{min-width:0}.copy{padding-top:6px}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#126ec6;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}.eyebrow:before{content:"";width:28px;height:2px;background:#126ec6}.copy h1{font-size:52px;line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.052em;margin:18px 0;color:#0e1d36}.copy>p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#53677e;max-width:510px}.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:23px}.chips span{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dbe5ed;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px;color:#4b6078;font-size:10px}
    .clock-art{height:238px;margin-top:15px;position:relative}.clock{position:absolute;left:58px;top:21px;width:176px;height:176px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;border:12px solid #e6eff7;box-shadow:0 24px 48px #17385818}.clock:before,.clock:after{content:"";position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform-origin:0 0;background:#173858;border-radius:99px}.clock:before{width:49px;height:5px;transform:rotate(-65deg)}.clock:after{width:58px;height:4px;transform:rotate(18deg);background:#ed9a3a}.clock b{position:absolute;inset:0;display:grid;place-items:center;padding-top:85px;font-size:10px;color:#62788f}.receipt{position:absolute;right:26px;top:38px;width:172px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d7e3eb;border-radius:15px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 20px 42px #17385815;transform:rotate(3deg)}.receipt small{font-size:8px;color:#6c8095}.receipt strong{display:block;font-size:24px;color:#173858;margin:7px 0 10px}.receipt span{font-size:9px;color:#197854;background:#e7f7ef;padding:5px 7px;border-radius:99px}.bonus-tag{position:absolute;left:8px;bottom:12px;background:#fff1d6;color:#865d18;border:1px solid #efd49a;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px;font-size:10px;font-weight:800}
    .calc{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d8e4eb;border-radius:20px;padding:26px 29px;box-shadow:0 25px 60px #173b6418;position:relative;z-index:2}.calc-title{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}.calc h2{font-size:23px;margin:0 0 4px}.calc-title p{font-size:10px;color:#60758c;margin:0}.tag{font-size:9px;color:#197854;background:#e7f7ef;border-radius:99px;padding:7px 10px;font-weight:800;height:max-content;white-space:nowrap}.section-label{font-size:10px;font-weight:850;color:#293b53;margin:17px 0 8px}.cases{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:7px}.case{border:1px solid #dce5ec;background:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:9px 4px;color:#52677f;font-size:8px;font-weight:750;min-height:66px}.case i{display:block;font-style:normal;font-size:17px;margin-bottom:3px}.case.active{border:2px solid #2479d1;background:#eff6ff;color:#155fa9}.fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:9px}.field{border:1px solid #dbe4eb;border-radius:10px;padding:9px 11px;min-height:57px}.field.wide{grid-column:span 2}.field label{display:block;color:#65798e;font-size:8px;margin-bottom:5px}.field input,.field select{border:0;outline:0;background:none;width:100%;color:#142641;font-weight:750;font-size:13px}.inline{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px}.inline b{font-size:12px}.advanced{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin:11px 0;color:#566d84;font-size:9px}.advanced button{border:0;background:none;color:#126ec6;font-size:9px;font-weight:800;padding:0}.extra{display:none;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:9px;margin-bottom:10px}.extra.open{display:grid}.result{background:#17324f;color:#fff;border-radius:15px;padding:18px 20px}.result-top{display:flex;align-items:start;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}.result small{font-size:9px;color:#c5d3df}.amount{font-size:34px;letter-spacing:-.04em;font-weight:850;margin-top:4px}.hour-card{background:#fff1d6;color:#76521b;border-radius:9px;padding:8px 11px;text-align:right}.hour-card small{color:inherit}.hour-card strong{display:block;font-size:15px}.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px;border-top:1px solid #375675;padding-top:12px;margin-top:13px}.stats span{font-size:8px;color:#b9cad8}.stats b{display:block;color:#fff;font-size:11px;margin-top:3px}.go{width:100%;border:0;border-radius:9px;background:#2479d1;color:#fff;font-weight:800;padding:12px;margin-top:14px}
    .breakdown{padding:74px 0 68px}.center{text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto 36px}.center span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#126ec6;font-weight:850}.center h2{font-size:36px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:10px 0}.center p{color:#5e7288;line-height:1.6}.break-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.08fr .92fr;gap:20px}.card{border:1px solid #dce5ec;border-radius:16px;padding:25px;box-shadow:0 10px 27px #1738580b;background:#fff}.card h3{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 19px}.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:145px 1fr 105px;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin:16px 0}.row span{font-size:10px;font-weight:750}.bar{height:8px;background:#edf2f6;border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden}.bar i{display:block;height:100%;border-radius:99px;background:#287bd3}.row:nth-child(3) .bar i{background:#ed9a3a}.row:nth-child(4) .bar i{background:#25a173}.row b{text-align:right;font-size:12px}.total{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid #e1e7ee;margin-top:20px;padding-top:17px}.total strong:last-child{color:#167a57;font-size:19px}.formula{background:#f7fafc}.formula-step{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:14px 0}.formula-step i{font-style:normal;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:10px;background:#e9f3ff;color:#126ec6;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:850}.formula-step b{display:block;font-size:10px}.formula-step span{display:block;color:#65798f;font-size:9px;margin-top:3px}.warning{background:#fff7e7;border:1px solid #efdaad;border-radius:11px;padding:13px;margin-top:17px;color:#755319;font-size:9px;line-height:1.55}
    .rates{background:#f4f8fb;padding:68px 0}.rate-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}.rate{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dce5ec;border-radius:15px;padding:22px;position:relative}.rate i{font-style:normal;font-size:25px}.rate h3{font-size:14px;margin:13px 0 6px}.rate p{font-size:10px;color:#61758b;line-height:1.55;min-height:48px}.rate strong{font-size:27px;color:#173452}.rate span{display:block;font-size:9px;color:#597087;margin-top:4px}.rate:nth-child(2){border:2px solid #ed9a3a}.rate:nth-child(2):before{content:"MAYOR RECARGO";position:absolute;right:13px;top:13px;background:#fff1d6;color:#805818;border-radius:99px;padding:5px 7px;font-size:7px;font-weight:850}
    .limits{padding:69px 0}.limits-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.75fr 1.25fr;gap:45px;align-items:center}.limits h2{font-size:36px;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:10px 0 14px}.limits p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;color:#60758a}.limit-card{background:#17324f;color:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:24px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px}.limit-card div{padding:8px 14px;border-right:1px solid #3a5570}.limit-card div:last-child{border:0}.limit-card small{display:block;color:#c0cfdd;font-size:8px}.limit-card b{display:block;font-size:24px;margin:7px 0}.limit-card span{font-size:8px;color:#b9cad8;line-height:1.4}.night{background:#17324f;color:#fff;padding:66px 0}.night-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.78fr 1.22fr;gap:48px;align-items:center}.night h2{font-size:35px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:10px 0 13px}.night p{color:#c0cfdd;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65}.night-card{background:#fff;color:#17324f;border-radius:16px;padding:22px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px}.night-card div{background:#f5f8fb;border-radius:11px;padding:15px;text-align:center}.night-card small{display:block;color:#61768b;font-size:8px}.night-card b{display:block;font-size:19px;margin:7px 0}.night-card span{font-size:8px;color:#5c7186}.foot{height:110px}
    @media(max-width:800px){.wrap{width:min(100% - 28px,1160px)}.links{display:none}.hero-grid,.break-grid,.limits-grid,.night-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.copy{text-align:center}.copy h1{font-size:39px}.eyebrow,.chips{justify-content:center}.clock-art{max-width:390px;margin-inline:auto}.calc{padding:20px 16px}.cases{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.rate-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.tools span:not(:last-child){display:none}}@media(max-width:480px){.copy h1{font-size:36px}.clock{left:17px}.receipt{right:0}.fields,.extra{grid-template-columns:1fr}.field.wide{grid-column:auto}.stats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.row{grid-template-columns:100px 1fr}.row b{grid-column:2}.limit-card,.night-card{grid-template-columns:1fr}.limit-card div{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid #3a5570}}

.support{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:40px;padding:70px 0}.support h2{font-size:24px}.support details{border-bottom:1px solid #dfe6ed;padding:14px 0}.support summary{font-size:12px;font-weight:750;cursor:pointer}.support p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.65;color:#5f7187}.support a{display:block;border:1px solid #dce5ee;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;margin:8px 0;color:#1769bd;text-decoration:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700}.support small{display:block;color:#65798d;margin-top:4px}
@media(max-width:800px){.support{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
